{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One Iced Latte</strong> is a story-driven <strong>visual novel</strong> made by two people inspired by <strong>romantic comedy anime</strong>. The game includes a <strong>streamer-friendly safe mode</strong>. Run your caf\u00e9 in a <strong>barista simulator</strong> and build relationships with your co-workers in a lighthearted <strong>dating sim</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>One sweltering day, Katsuki-kun wanders into a modest little caf\u00e9 called Milk Milk Coffee. There, he encounters the charming, busty barista Moka. Smitten with her at first sight, and flustered beyond measure, he blurts out a request for coffee with\u2026 breast milk. From that moment on, his life is destined to change forever!</i><br> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew a lot of coffee!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with drinks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relationships with beautiful baristas!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase the popularity of the coffee shop!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778850/extras/5da634e0f6bfff05e92ea86d81e89c14.avif?t=1772648082\" width=600 height=746 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778850/extras/acb0e02e04aee48acc1c4b222d2491e6.avif?t=1772648082\" width=600 height=746 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778850/extras/6afc9a60d042a376ffd9eab1cd58cc7f.avif?t=1772648082\" width=600 height=746 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300c\u30